1
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,520
Miss Song is no stranger to our family.

2
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:25,479
So in the future,

3
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,159
we might even become family.

4
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:27,479
Isn't that right?

5
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,479
Speaking of acquaintances,

6
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:30,280
my acquaintances in the Cheng family

7
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,479
aren't limited to just Cheng An.

8
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:32,560
Sang Luo,

9
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,520
it's been a few years.

10
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,080
I could hardly recognize you.

11
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,120
You two know each other?

12
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,280
When I first met Sang Luo,

13
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,439
I had no idea she was a Cheng.

14
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,759
I...

15
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,599
only recently returned to the Cheng family

16
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:14,759
and reclaimed my identity.

17
00:03:17,919 --> 00:03:18,599
So,

18
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,240
have you been well these past few years?

19
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,560
What happened to your hand?

20
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:27,879
Got injured, but it's nothing serious.

21
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,800
Eldest daughter-in-law,

22
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:34,039
go check the kitchen.

23
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,800
See how the food is coming along.

24
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,599
Cheng Yan,

25
00:03:37,919 --> 00:03:38,840
take Song Yun

26
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,520
for a walk in the courtyard.

27
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,840
Get to know each other better.

28
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:42,840
Okay.

29
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,199
I've looked into it.

30
00:04:00,639 --> 00:04:02,479
Ten years ago, Song Yun went against her parents' wishes

31
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,120
and worked as a nurse for a year.

32
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,639
During that time,

33
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,800
Sang Luo happened to be in the hospital.

34
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,599
Got it.

35
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,120
As for the relationship between them,

36
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:10,400
it's still not very clear.

37
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,560
Since they're old acquaintances,

38
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,560
I'm afraid she won't be easy to deal with.

39
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:17,439
I just don't know if Song Yun is here for the marriage alliance,

40
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,839
or something else.

41
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,160
You don't need to worry about that.

42
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:22,240
I've already sent someone to look for

43
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,079
the former staff of Benevolence Hospital.

44
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,720
We should find some useful clues.

45
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,680
Actually, the root of this matter

46
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:29,000
lies with Cheng An and Cheng Yan.

47
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,560
They are competing against each other.

48
00:04:32,759 --> 00:04:33,680
Otherwise, Song Yun alone

49
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,279
wouldn't be able to make waves.

50
00:04:43,079 --> 00:04:45,399
Whether using a marriage alliance to keep his status,

51
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,839
or making a calculated move

52
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,040
to proactively cooperate,

53
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,680
he is profit-driven,

54
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:51,879
hypocritical,

55
00:04:52,319 --> 00:04:53,120
and deceitful.

56
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:56,240
This is the real Cheng An.

57
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,879
This is all thanks to you Chengs.

58
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:07,079
This is what you all owe me.

59
00:05:07,480 --> 00:05:08,839
They are clearly not the same person,

60
00:05:09,839 --> 00:05:11,600
so why does she feel so familiar?

61
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:15,680
Are you free tomorrow?

62
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,160
I'd like to meet with you.

63
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:23,560
Anytime.

64
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,040
I didn't expect Sang Luo and the Song family

65
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:29,000
to have a connection.

66
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:37,959
Miss Song.

67
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,120
Wouldn't it be better to find a quiet place?

68
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,920
Why did you have to come to Valley Breeze?

69
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,240
The public is optimistic about the Cheng-Song marriage alliance.

70
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,240
To be prudent,

71
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,759
I need to understand

72
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,319
Valley Breeze Group's operations.

73
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:50,680
If we establish

74
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:52,399
a loveless business marriage alliance,

75
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,759
I will help you become

76
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:55,199
the sole heir of the Cheng family.

77
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,439
Then, Miss Song,

78
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,199
why did you choose me?

79
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,480
Compared to

80
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,399
Cheng Yan, whose scandals are everywhere,

81
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:07,720
Anxin Group needs a smart

82
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:10,000
and highly capable son-in-law.

83
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,120
You flatter me, Miss Song.

84
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:16,040
I know

85
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:18,759
Cheng Yan was instigated by Old Madam Cheng

86
00:06:19,279 --> 00:06:20,519
and has been pestering you.

87
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,720
Rest assured,

88
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,000
leave this matter to me.

89
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,759
I knew I made the right choice.

90
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:26,600
All right.

91
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:27,720
I don't have any other questions.

92
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:28,720
Miss Song.

93
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,480
Wait a moment.

94
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,639
I have one last question.

95
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,839
Is your return to the country this time

96
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,720
because of Sang Luo?

97
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,759
That is my private matter.

98
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,000
Miss Song.

99
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,360
This way is the sales department.

100
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,399
Ahead is

101
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:47,639
the R&D department.

102
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,399
Wow.

103
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,360
Uncle and Miss Song are really a good match.

104
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,240
A perfect couple.

105
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:57,639
It seems

106
00:06:58,160 --> 00:06:59,879
you've already accepted her as your aunt.

107
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,120
Don't worry, Aunt Lin.

108
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,920
I'm still on your side.

109
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,759
It's just that...

110
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,560
It's just that Uncle looks like

111
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:09,680
he's quite smitten with Miss Song.

112
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,439
That's quite nice.

113
00:07:22,639 --> 00:07:24,720
Thank you for showing me around the company today.

114
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,800
I need to use the restroom first.

115
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,800
Excuse me.

116
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,519
My bracelet.

117
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,560
I've been looking for it for so long.

118
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,759
A very important friend of mine

119
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:48,639
gave it to me.

120
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,160
Returned to its rightful owner.

121
00:07:53,279 --> 00:07:54,720
Do you still remember this bracelet?

122
00:08:05,439 --> 00:08:06,240
Of course.

123
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:07,519
Sister Song Yun.

124
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,279
I didn't expect that after all these years,

125
00:08:09,279 --> 00:08:10,639
you'd keep it in such good condition.

126
00:08:13,439 --> 00:08:14,240
Yeah.

127
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,160
I remember when you were little,

128
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,000
you'd always call me Sister Song Yun.

129
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:20,279
I can't believe you're all grown up.

130
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,240
Yeah, exactly.

131
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,879
Our childhood days

132
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,920
were always so happy.

133
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,079
So carefree.

134
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,360
Do you know what the real Sang Luo

135
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:30,639
used to call me?

136
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,240
She never called me Sister Song Yun.

137
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,480
Instead, she called me

138
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,200
Sister Song.

139
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:40,279
I knew Sister Song

140
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,720
could definitely do it!

141
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,600
Is this for me?

142
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:50,320
I remember when you were little,

143
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,919
you had a unique birthmark.

144
00:08:53,279 --> 00:08:54,399
Can I see it?

145
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:05,960
You're talking about this, right?

146
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:08,039
I was in an accident once.

147
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,799
I can't remember a lot of people and things.

148
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,799
After I got burned here,

149
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,720
the birthmark disappeared.

150
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:16,240
I didn't expect so many coincidences

151
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,480
and hardships to happen to you all at once.

152
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,480
When you were little,

153
00:09:23,799 --> 00:09:25,039
you always loved chatting with me.

154
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:26,960
Why does it feel like now you're grown,

155
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,320
your words carry a hidden meaning?

156
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,000
Can a person's personality

157
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,440
really change?

158
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,399
It can,

159
00:09:33,679 --> 00:09:34,559
Sister Song Yun.

160
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:37,320
Yeah.

161
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:39,159
People do change.

162
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,840
But some things

163
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,559
will never change.

164
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,480
How did you and Song Yun meet?

165
00:10:15,559 --> 00:10:17,600
Aren't you being a bit too nosy?

166
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,279
Who I meet

167
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:19,960
and how long I've known them

168
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,279
is my own private business.

169
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:23,039
Or could it be

170
00:10:23,399 --> 00:10:24,799
that you want to use me, Uncle,

171
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:26,679
to scout your marriage alliance partner?

172
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,200
You could say that.

173
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,279
What?

174
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,240
You really want a marriage alliance with her?

175
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,120
It seems I don't have any other choice.

176
00:10:38,559 --> 00:10:39,440
Uncle,

177
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,720
you look so pathetic weighing the pros and cons.

178
00:11:00,519 --> 00:11:01,440
Do you have a death wish?

179
00:11:01,559 --> 00:11:02,720
How long has it been since your miscarriage?

180
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,879
What else can I do?

181
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:09,799
Old Madam Cheng wants a marriage alliance.

182
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,320
Whether it's Cheng An or Cheng Yan,

183
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,639
whoever marries Song Yun,

184
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:14,320
she will walk all over me.

185
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:17,159
If they find out I lost the baby,

186
00:11:17,159 --> 00:11:19,039
I'll have nothing left.

187
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:21,080
You still have me.

188
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,399
Wanmei,

189
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,480
leave the Cheng family.

190
00:11:24,919 --> 00:11:26,360
I can stay by your side forever.

191
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,240
No.

192
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:31,120
Even if it's for our child,

193
00:11:31,759 --> 00:11:33,559
I absolutely cannot leave the Cheng family.

194
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:36,000
I absolutely cannot let Song Yun marry into the Cheng family.

195
00:11:36,679 --> 00:11:37,799
Everything in the Cheng family...

196
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,559
I am determined to get it all.

197
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:49,840
Ms. Song!

198
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,200
I like you!

199
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,320
Will you be my girlfriend?

200
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:56,679
Mr. Yan,

201
00:11:56,879 --> 00:11:58,360
I'm not interested in you.

202
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,240
Please step aside.

203
00:11:59,240 --> 00:11:59,960
Song Yun!

204
00:12:00,559 --> 00:12:01,720
Ever since I met you,

205
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:03,879
I finally know what love is,

206
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,159
and what makes my heart race.

207
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,320
Will you marry me?

208
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:07,919
Marry him!

209
00:12:08,039 --> 00:12:08,840
Marry him!

210
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:09,759
Marry him!

211
00:12:09,879 --> 00:12:10,799
Marry him!

212
00:12:10,919 --> 00:12:11,679
No, no, no.

213
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,000
Ms. Song,

214
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:14,000
if you don't say yes,

215
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,240
I won't let you leave.

216
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,720
Yan!

217
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,759
What are you doing here?

218
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,879
What are you...

219
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:21,080
Who is this?

220
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:22,720
I don't know her!

221
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,639
Didn't you say I was the only one in your heart?

222
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,919
I don't know her!

223
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:26,679
Cheng Yan!

224
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:29,159
You called me sweetie last night!

225
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:29,960
When did I...

226
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:30,759
And now you pretend not to know me?

227
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,039
Mr. Yan,

228
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,879
I think

229
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:35,120
you should clean yourself up first.

230
00:12:35,519 --> 00:12:36,799
Don't waste my time.

231
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:38,639
I'm pretty clean!

232
00:12:38,639 --> 00:12:39,240
Don't go!

233
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:39,919
Ms. Song!

234
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:40,960
Where are you going?

235
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,240
I...

236
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,320
What are you doing?

237
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:44,679
Are you crazy?

238
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,679
Mom! Mom! Stop hitting me!

239
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:47,080
Stop!

240
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,039
You can't do anything right!

241
00:12:48,159 --> 00:12:49,200
You just ruin everything!

242
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:53,039
You ruined a perfectly good situation!

243
00:12:53,039 --> 00:12:53,799
I was wrong.

244
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:54,159
I...

245
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:54,480
Mom,

246
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:56,480
I swear, that little model and I

247
00:12:56,679 --> 00:12:57,720
are completely over!

248
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:58,559
I swear!

249
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:08,720
Mom.

250
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:10,879
I really messed up.

251
00:13:11,679 --> 00:13:13,159
Help me figure out

252
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,960
what I should do next.

253
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,360
Do you think I'm like you,

254
00:13:18,879 --> 00:13:20,799
panicking at the last minute?

255
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:23,519
Brilliant.

256
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:24,679
Mom,

257
00:13:24,879 --> 00:13:25,399
what's the plan?

258
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:26,120
Oh, you...

259
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,679
Leak the news

260
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,159
and tell everyone

261
00:13:29,519 --> 00:13:31,759
that Song Yun finally chose to marry you

262
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,120
and gave up on Cheng An.

263
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,000
Will that work?

264
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,720
Won't Song Yun tear me apart?

265
00:13:37,519 --> 00:13:39,559
I've already spoken with Song Yun's stepmother.

266
00:13:39,879 --> 00:13:42,240
Valley Breeze's chairman can only be you.

267
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,960
Song Yun will be the chairman's wife.

268
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:46,000
The more high-profile

269
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:47,519
you make this news,

270
00:13:47,679 --> 00:13:48,480
the harder it will be

271
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:49,720
for the Song family to back out.

272
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,440
To save face,

273
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:53,759
she'll have to swallow this marriage.

274
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,360
High-profile...

275
00:13:58,759 --> 00:13:59,679
High-profile.

276
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:03,600
Being high-profile is what I do best!

277
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,399
Remember

278
00:14:04,399 --> 00:14:05,600
to go apologize to her.

279
00:14:05,679 --> 00:14:06,960
Let her see your sincerity.

280
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:08,279
Got it, Mom.

281
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:09,480
Love you.

282
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,480
This is Song Yun's file.

283
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:17,360
She's highly suspicious by nature.

284
00:14:17,759 --> 00:14:19,519
She won't let go of her doubts about you easily.

285
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,080
I know.

286
00:14:24,639 --> 00:14:26,200
Then you'd better keep your distance from her.

287
00:14:26,759 --> 00:14:28,360
As for the Cheng-Song marriage alliance,

288
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,360
we can figure out another way.

289
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,759
A single spark

290
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,200
can start a prairie fire.

291
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,759
Hurry up.

292
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:51,320
Why aren't you anxious at all?

293
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,159
Come here.

294
00:14:52,159 --> 00:14:52,799
Sit down.

295
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:55,679
Help your Second Uncle choose.

296
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:56,519
Look at these.

297
00:14:56,519 --> 00:14:57,320
The vintage one.

298
00:14:58,039 --> 00:14:58,879
The modern one.

299
00:14:58,879 --> 00:15:00,639
And this designer collaboration.

300
00:15:00,639 --> 00:15:01,960
I don't even know what this stuff is.

301
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,679
Tell me.

302
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:05,480
Which one would Song Yun like?

303
00:15:05,919 --> 00:15:06,919
Let me take a look.

304
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,039
Take a look.

305
00:15:15,639 --> 00:15:16,759
She won't like any of them.

306
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,519
No way.

307
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,679
With things like these,

308
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:21,960
if I gave them to any other girl,

309
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,399
she'd be totally mesmerized.

310
00:15:23,759 --> 00:15:25,679
Song Yun has seen it all.

311
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:26,679
Second Uncle.

312
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:28,519
Look at what you've picked.

313
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,279
Why would she like any of these?

314
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,240
What should I do then?

315
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,840
What Song Yun has always wanted

316
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,120
is your sincere heart, Second Uncle.

317
00:15:39,679 --> 00:15:40,919
But instead,

318
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:44,159
you shoved your affair right in her face.

319
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:47,559
Who would've thought

320
00:15:47,559 --> 00:15:49,799
Tripped up at the last minute?

321
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,960
That girl had to be so blind

322
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,879
to cling to me at such a crucial moment.

323
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:57,000
Little niece,

324
00:15:57,879 --> 00:15:59,919
your Second Uncle has never been

325
00:15:59,919 --> 00:16:01,200
this devoted to a girl.

326
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,720
Help your Second Uncle figure out a way.

327
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,039
How can I

328
00:16:05,759 --> 00:16:07,279
turn this around?

329
00:16:07,879 --> 00:16:09,639
You really want to marry her?

330
00:16:10,279 --> 00:16:11,200
I really do.

331
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:13,240
You really want to marry into her family.

332
00:16:13,759 --> 00:16:15,639
I'm dead set on it.

333
00:16:18,279 --> 00:16:20,399
Who is the current head of the Song family?

334
00:16:21,639 --> 00:16:23,440
Song Qingfeng.

335
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:26,759
Song Yun was called back by her father.

336
00:16:27,519 --> 00:16:29,320
Since you can't win over Song Yun,

337
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,000
win over someone else instead.

338
00:16:32,039 --> 00:16:32,840
Give these

339
00:16:32,919 --> 00:16:33,799
to her father.

340
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,120
Tell me, tell me.

341
00:16:36,799 --> 00:16:39,200
Song Yun's father loves antiques.

342
00:16:40,399 --> 00:16:41,080
Second Uncle.

343
00:16:41,679 --> 00:16:42,519
Think about it.

344
00:16:44,159 --> 00:16:47,039
To catch the bandits, first catch their leader.

345
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:47,919
Exactly.

346
00:16:48,559 --> 00:16:50,360
Brilliant, niece.

347
00:16:51,279 --> 00:16:52,080
Got it.

348
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:53,519
I'll give these

349
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:54,919
to you.

350
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,840
Thank you, Second Uncle.

351
00:16:59,799 --> 00:17:01,679
Sometimes I really don't understand.

352
00:17:02,279 --> 00:17:04,240
Are you on my side

353
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,079
or Cheng Yan's side?

354
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:11,920
What good does it do me to help Cheng Yan?

355
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,880
Auntie Lin.

356
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:15,359
After all,

357
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:18,240
we are true family.

358
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:24,440
Cheng Yan came to you for help.

359
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:27,640
As expected,

360
00:17:27,640 --> 00:17:29,640
nothing gets past you, Auntie Lin.

361
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,640
He begged me

362
00:17:33,599 --> 00:17:35,000
to give him ideas

363
00:17:35,359 --> 00:17:36,920
to win over Miss Song.

364
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,119
And you?

365
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:42,240
Are you going to help Cheng Yan marry Song Yun?

366
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:45,960
I think

367
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:49,119
Auntie Lin probably wants even less for my uncle

368
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:50,519
to get engaged to Song Yun.

369
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:57,799
Uncle Song.

370
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:59,400
This is

371
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,480
a little gift I prepared for you.

372
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,640
Just a small token of my respect.

373
00:18:05,759 --> 00:18:06,599
I know

374
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:09,359
you have a deep knowledge of antiques.

375
00:18:09,400 --> 00:18:10,480
These little trinkets

376
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,160
definitely won't catch your eye.

377
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:13,720
Therefore,

378
00:18:14,079 --> 00:18:15,440
I also prepared this.

379
00:18:16,599 --> 00:18:17,400
Please take a look.

380
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:24,960
Uncle Song,

381
00:18:25,079 --> 00:18:25,759
I know

382
00:18:26,079 --> 00:18:27,799
you're worried your precious daughter,

383
00:18:27,839 --> 00:18:29,319
your Treasure, being wronged.

384
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,279
To be honest,

385
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,720
my romantic life over the years

386
00:18:32,759 --> 00:18:34,160
has been full of dark clouds.

387
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,079
But ever since I met Song Yun,

388
00:18:36,119 --> 00:18:37,920
she's been like a ray of sunshine,

389
00:18:38,519 --> 00:18:40,079
melting my hardened heart.

390
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,400
My mother and I have discussed this.

391
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:44,400
As long as Song Yun is willing to marry me,

392
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:46,160
a portion of our shares

393
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,839
will be transferred to her name.

394
00:18:49,599 --> 00:18:51,839
Does Old Madam Cheng know about this?

395
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:53,240
Of course.

396
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,559
My mother has nothing but praise for her.

397
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,480
Uncle,

398
00:19:01,039 --> 00:19:02,039
this is something I asked a friend

399
00:19:02,039 --> 00:19:03,440
to specially prepare: Kyara.

400
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,119
If you don't like it,

401
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:06,680
as the saying goes,

402
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:09,119
It's the thought that counts.

403
00:19:10,559 --> 00:19:11,359
Dad.

404
00:19:12,839 --> 00:19:13,720
Are you planning

405
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:16,119
to trade your daughter for these cheap beads?

406
00:19:16,799 --> 00:19:17,599
Yun!

407
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:19,079
Back then, Aunt Zhao

408
00:19:19,079 --> 00:19:20,920
seduced you over appreciating antiques,

409
00:19:21,160 --> 00:19:23,279
driving my mother to her death.

410
00:19:23,359 --> 00:19:24,160
What,

411
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,519
because of these cheap beads,

412
00:19:26,519 --> 00:19:28,480
you'd sell your daughter to the Chengs?

413
00:19:31,119 --> 00:19:31,920
You!

414
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,559
Are you trying to make me die of anger?

415
00:19:33,559 --> 00:19:34,039
Uncle,

416
00:19:34,039 --> 00:19:35,160
hit me if you're angry.

417
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,000
Don't hit Yun.

418
00:19:36,759 --> 00:19:38,880
Only people with a conscience die of anger.

419
00:19:39,599 --> 00:19:40,920
But looking at you two,

420
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,720
I don't see a shred of conscience.

421
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:43,839
As for this marriage,

422
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,279
whoever wants it can have it!

423
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:47,799
Yun!

424
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:48,640
Yun!

425
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:50,440
You're marrying him whether you want to or not!

426
00:19:54,519 --> 00:19:55,359
Cheng Yan,

427
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,880
your marriage is settled.

428
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,920
Thank you, Uncle.

429
00:20:07,839 --> 00:20:08,519
Yan!

430
00:20:08,720 --> 00:20:09,559
You're here!

431
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:13,799
Sit here.

432
00:20:16,799 --> 00:20:18,160
I missed you so much.

433
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:20,799
Tonight,

434
00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:22,839
drink up and have fun!

435
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,680
Drinks are on me!

436
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:26,039
Yeah!

437
00:20:26,680 --> 00:20:29,079
Let's toast to Mr. Yan!

438
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:32,119
Cheers!

439
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:39,119
You're getting married,

440
00:20:39,119 --> 00:20:40,319
so why are you here looking for me?

441
00:20:41,279 --> 00:20:42,519
Just because I'm getting married,

442
00:20:43,039 --> 00:20:45,039
does that mean you're not my little baby?

443
00:20:47,279 --> 00:20:48,799
That woman from the Song family

444
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,680
is a total bore.

445
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,400
Unlike you.

446
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,720
You're always so much fun.

447
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:00,720
She's the only precious child of the Song family.

448
00:21:01,119 --> 00:21:03,640
All the future fortune belongs to her.

449
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,920
Once I have her in my hands,

450
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:07,960
all this future fortune

451
00:21:08,839 --> 00:21:10,400
will belong to me.

452
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,160
What are you so happy about?

453
00:21:21,839 --> 00:21:22,680
Nothing.

454
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:38,039
Yucheng.

455
00:21:38,599 --> 00:21:39,920
Give me another baby.

456
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,680
I need a baby.

457
00:21:41,880 --> 00:21:42,519
No.

458
00:21:42,839 --> 00:21:44,240
You're in Post-miscarriage confinement.

459
00:21:44,480 --> 00:21:46,319
I can't let you hurt your body like this.

460
00:21:55,799 --> 00:21:56,759
I don't care.

461
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,519
But I do.

462
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,519
If you care about me,

463
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,519
just give me what I want.

464
00:22:04,799 --> 00:22:05,599
Right now.

465
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:19,079
The Cheng and Song families

466
00:22:19,079 --> 00:22:22,559
are highly influential in business.

467
00:22:23,079 --> 00:22:24,519
We have always adhered to

468
00:22:24,519 --> 00:22:27,319
the philosophy of integrity and progress.

469
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:28,880
The two families

470
00:22:28,880 --> 00:22:31,720
are united by our children's bond.

471
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:34,519
This can be considered a perfect match,

472
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:36,000
an alliance of well-matched families.

473
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:37,319
Now,

474
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:39,279
I officially announce...

475
00:22:39,799 --> 00:22:41,200
That woman from the Song family

476
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:42,880
is a total bore.

477
00:22:43,359 --> 00:22:43,920
Look!

478
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,920
Isn't that Director Yan?

479
00:22:47,039 --> 00:22:47,720
Who did this?!

480
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:48,559
Turn it off!

481
00:22:49,319 --> 00:22:49,880
Turn it off!

482
00:22:50,839 --> 00:22:51,400
Turn it off!

483
00:22:52,359 --> 00:22:53,279
Stop filming! Stop filming!

484
00:22:53,759 --> 00:22:54,519
Stop filming!

485
00:22:57,079 --> 00:22:57,960
all this future fortune

486
00:22:57,960 --> 00:22:58,400
Stop filming!

487
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:01,000
will belong to me!

488
00:23:03,319 --> 00:23:05,039
Yun, you have to believe me!

489
00:23:05,079 --> 00:23:06,119
It's all fake!

490
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:07,960
It's corporate spies.

491
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:09,839
Technology is so advanced now,

492
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,920
it's all AI-generated!

493
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:14,200
Is the audio AI too?

494
00:23:17,759 --> 00:23:18,640
Yun,

495
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,799
there might be some misunderstanding here.

496
00:23:21,799 --> 00:23:22,559
However,

497
00:23:23,079 --> 00:23:25,839
Cheng Yan is definitely unworthy of you.

498
00:23:26,519 --> 00:23:28,880
But our Cheng An is quite good too.

499
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,680
You could consider him!

500
00:23:37,359 --> 00:23:38,160
Cheng Yan,

501
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,519
for what you've done,

502
00:23:42,559 --> 00:23:44,519
I'll never forgive you as long as I live.

503
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,079
Our Song family

504
00:23:49,359 --> 00:23:50,920
has its own pride.

505
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:52,920
And I have my own bottom line.

506
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:55,279
I will never let a marriage alliance

507
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:58,240
ruin me.

508
00:23:59,079 --> 00:24:00,640
Well said, Yun.

509
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,240
Even though she's a girl,

510
00:24:04,079 --> 00:24:05,599
she is fully capable of

511
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,559
inheriting the Song family business.

512
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,640
She is our pride,

513
00:24:09,880 --> 00:24:11,680
not someone to be bullied.

514
00:24:12,079 --> 00:24:13,279
This marriage alliance

515
00:24:13,759 --> 00:24:14,720
is hereby canceled.

516
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,279
Yun,

517
00:24:16,759 --> 00:24:17,559
let's go.

518
00:24:23,839 --> 00:24:24,759
Stop filming!

519
00:24:24,759 --> 00:24:25,720
Stop filming!

520
00:24:26,079 --> 00:24:27,039
What are you filming?!

521
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:28,880
Get lost!

522
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,519
Director Sang, going for lunch?

523
00:24:37,599 --> 00:24:38,359
You guys go ahead.

524
00:24:38,359 --> 00:24:39,240
Okay.

525
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:42,799
Sang Luo.

526
00:24:50,799 --> 00:24:51,960
Is this your doing again?

527
00:24:52,319 --> 00:24:53,839
I should be the one asking you that.

528
00:24:54,559 --> 00:24:55,720
After all, the ones fighting over a wife

529
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:57,559
are Youngest Uncle and Second Uncle.

530
00:24:58,279 --> 00:24:59,920
Word has spread everywhere now

531
00:25:00,359 --> 00:25:03,400
that the Cheng family competition is fierce.

532
00:25:05,559 --> 00:25:06,599
It's best if it wasn't you.

533
00:25:06,680 --> 00:25:07,839
Of course it wasn't me.

534
00:25:13,559 --> 00:25:15,279
But I am quite curious.

535
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:17,039
Youngest Uncle, what does

536
00:25:17,039 --> 00:25:18,200
your current attitude mean?

537
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:20,400
Did Song Yun reject the marriage alliance,

538
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:21,920
making you want to marry her so badly?

539
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:22,960
Do you like her that much?

540
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:28,799
Whether I like her or not

541
00:25:28,799 --> 00:25:30,160
is my own business.

542
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:34,000
Everything I do is for Valley Breeze.

543
00:25:35,119 --> 00:25:36,240
Everything else

544
00:25:36,319 --> 00:25:37,559
must make way for it.

545
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:05,519
Alright.

546
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:06,519
Got it.

547
00:26:11,119 --> 00:26:11,920
Who was that?

548
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:13,480
Work.

549
00:26:15,559 --> 00:26:17,119
Are you leaving then?

550
00:26:17,759 --> 00:26:18,559
I'm not leaving.

551
00:26:19,599 --> 00:26:20,640
I promised you

552
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:22,559
that I'd put you first,

553
00:26:23,079 --> 00:26:24,880
and everything else comes second.

554
00:26:25,599 --> 00:26:26,640
So today,

555
00:26:26,640 --> 00:26:28,920
I'll stay home with you all day.

556
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:35,599
Liar.

557
00:26:38,359 --> 00:26:39,480
Thanks for your help.

558
00:26:40,079 --> 00:26:40,960
A pleasure doing business.

559
00:26:41,839 --> 00:26:43,839
She's the only precious child of the Song family.

560
00:26:44,119 --> 00:26:46,880
All the future fortune belongs to her.

561
00:26:47,119 --> 00:26:49,000
Once I have her in my hands,

562
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:50,359
all this future fortune

563
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:52,039
will belong to me.

564
00:26:52,359 --> 00:26:53,400
It's just a win-win.

565
00:26:53,799 --> 00:26:54,599
Thank you.

566
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,839
I know you like Cheng An,

567
00:26:59,279 --> 00:27:00,880
but I couldn't have him,

568
00:27:01,400 --> 00:27:02,640
and you have no chance either.

569
00:27:04,799 --> 00:27:06,279
Stop your wishful thinking.

570
00:27:16,559 --> 00:27:17,640
Psycho.

571
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:43,680
After I publicly rejected the marriage alliance,

572
00:27:43,960 --> 00:27:45,599
I didn't expect you to ask me out alone.

573
00:27:46,880 --> 00:27:48,200
To take over Valley Breeze Group,

574
00:27:48,559 --> 00:27:50,480
don't use a marriage alliance as a shortcut.

575
00:27:51,039 --> 00:27:51,839
So,

576
00:27:53,559 --> 00:27:54,960
you have someone else in your heart?

577
00:27:59,359 --> 00:28:00,160
It doesn't matter.

578
00:28:00,559 --> 00:28:01,680
The reason I asked you out this time

579
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:03,720
is to ask you about Sang Luo.

580
00:28:05,720 --> 00:28:06,880
You know her well, right?

581
00:28:10,279 --> 00:28:11,079
Back then,

582
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:14,039
I didn't want to follow my parents' plan

583
00:28:14,039 --> 00:28:15,279
to join the family business,

584
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,839
so I sneaked off to volunteer at a hospital.

585
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:20,720
Sang Luo was the first patient I met.

586
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:23,519
She was the most optimistic

587
00:28:23,559 --> 00:28:24,880
and kindest girl I had ever met.

588
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:26,960
Even though it was just a short year,

589
00:28:27,319 --> 00:28:29,440
we became the best of friends.

590
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:30,799
But then,

591
00:28:31,519 --> 00:28:33,400
my parents tricked me into going abroad,

592
00:28:34,359 --> 00:28:36,480
and I couldn't even give her a proper goodbye.

593
00:28:36,839 --> 00:28:37,640
So,

594
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,480
do you think the current Sang Luo

595
00:28:42,279 --> 00:28:43,559
is the real Sang Luo?

596
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,279
Actually, all these years I've been

597
00:28:48,279 --> 00:28:49,880
keeping an eye out for Sang Luo's whereabouts.

598
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,200
This time,

599
00:28:51,319 --> 00:28:53,599
If I hadn't heard Sang Luo returned,

600
00:28:53,759 --> 00:28:56,079
I'd never agree to the marriage alliance.

601
00:28:56,759 --> 00:28:58,960
But after I came to the Cheng family, I realized...

602
00:28:59,759 --> 00:29:00,920
the person she is now

603
00:29:01,519 --> 00:29:02,839
and the one I remember

604
00:29:02,839 --> 00:29:04,079
are nothing alike.

605
00:29:07,279 --> 00:29:08,279
You mean...
